  "about": "The one list of a paper's states for the app chip (mobile/lib/core/status/paper_state.dart) and the web chip. Every state shows icon + colour + Bengali text together (WCAG 2.2 SC 1.4.1). Owner-approved design: E:\\ABOS\\মালিকের-ফাইল\\অ্যাপের-বার-চূড়ান্ত-নকশা-সংস্করণ-৩-২০-অক্টোবর.pdf, part 5 (20 Oct 2026). A change here must be made in paper_state.dart too; mobile/test/status/paper_states_json_test.dart fails on any drift.",
  "source": {
    "colours": "SAP Fiori Horizon theme semantic parameters, @sap-theming/theming-base-content 11.29.3 (Theming Engine 15.0.8)",
    "light": "https://unpkg.com/@sap-theming/theming-base-content@11.29.3/content/Base/baseLib/sap_horizon/css_variables.css",
    "dark": "https://unpkg.com/@sap-theming/theming-base-content@11.29.3/content/Base/baseLib/sap_horizon_dark/css_variables.css",
    "repository": "https://github.com/SAP/theming-base-content",
    "icons": "Material Symbols, Rounded style (https://fonts.google.com/icons), Apache-2.0",
    "contrast": "WCAG 2.2 SC 1.4.3 (text 4.5:1) and SC 1.4.11; foreground is used for both the text and the icon"
  },
  "placeholders": {
    "level": "the level now waiting for its approval (1-based), from the data",
    "levels": "how many levels the paper needs, from the data",
    "digits": "latin (0-9) everywhere, levels too ('2-এর 1', 'ধাপ 1'), as money (owner's খ) and the web's dates ('20 অক্টোবর 2026'); the words stay Bengali (fe, 20 Oct 2026, correcting the sample's '২-এর ১')"
  },
  "kinds": {
    "about": "One state, words by the paper's kind: a key '<name>_<kind>' (e.g. label_bn_stock) replaces '<name>' for that kind when present; otherwise the plain key is used.",
